"Menu path (JSON array)" = "菜单路径（JSON 数组）";
"Enter the exact menu titles as they appear in the app, including language, capitalization and punctuation, as a JSON array of 2 to 8 titles, for example [\"File\", \"New\"]. Unknown or misspelled titles make the action fail. Titles are never trimmed, guessed, or joined." = "输入与应用中完全一致的菜单标题（包括语言、大小写和标点），使用 2 到 8 个标题的 JSON 数组，例如 [\"File\", \"New\"]。标题未知或拼写不一致时动作会失败。标题不会被裁剪、猜测或拼接。";
"Only the final menu item is pressed; parent menus are never opened automatically, so apps with dynamic submenus may be unavailable. Requires Accessibility permission." = "只按下最后一级菜单项，绝不会自动打开父级菜单，因此使用动态子菜单的应用可能不可用。需要辅助功能权限。";
